      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DUNQUIN (1) did a good job last start to finish second at this track over 1200m, beaten only 0.6 lengths. That run should have him rock-hard fit now. Big threat over the longer journey and can go one better against this lot. NUGGET SMART (6) has been in the money at his last couple of runs, the latest when second over 1400m at Tuncurry. Another top-three finish is on the cards. YACHT GIRL (5) is yet to fill a placing in two runs since resuming from a spell, the latest when 11th over 1400m at this circuit after she travelled towards the rear of the field. Should be peaking now and is expected to do much better. HINTO (3) was safely held when ninth last start over 1400m at Rosehill, beaten 3.5 lengths. That followed a good first-up win at Gunnedah. Strips fitter third-up from the break and has the talent to find the winners' list.",
